# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 0825c0ab66bae684b72a4f6899dddf57db74a6129f302ea5efd00ef31cc729d3
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 3a5e596086d6746deace93fa6b1f8e6fb41ffe7fc35d06eedfd857b461f30a30
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm d5d53fab483d0469087920f6a7a7b14a92669a5ba8b9df259e8724e1546b223e
